  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #333399;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">WORLD ENVIRONMENT MONTH CELEBRATION</span></span><span style=\"color: #000080;\">&nbsp;</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">As part of World Environment Month celebrations, a tree-planting programme was organized at the ATME College of engineering, located on the Mysuru–Bannur Road in Mysuru city.on 24th June2025.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">With the cooperation of ATME College and NSS, the World Environment Month was observed by planting and watering hundreds of saplings of various species within the college campus.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The programme was inaugurated by the Chairman of the College Governing Council, Sri. L. Arun Kumar, by planting and watering a sapling, thereby launching the Environment Month activities.</p>\n\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/World-Environment-Day-25.pdf\" data-wp-editing=\"1\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">DOWNLOAD&nbsp; REPORT</span>[/caption]",
